\033[38;5;223m  HOW TO BROWSE\033[0m

\033[38;5;87m  Links and form controls have numbers. Type a number and press Enter\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  to activate it. Use Up and Down to scroll; hold an arrow for continuous\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  scrolling. J and K scroll one line at a time.\033[0m


\033[38;5;223m  BROWSER KEYS\033[0m

\033[38;5;120m  WHY+E\033[0m  Enter a new URL             \033[38;5;120mWHY+F\033[0m  Add/remove bookmark
\033[38;5;120m  WHY+C\033[0m  Edit current URL            \033[38;5;120mWHY+M\033[0m  Bookmarks
\033[38;5;120m  WHY+H\033[0m  Home                        \033[38;5;120mWHY+O\033[0m  Display mode options
\033[38;5;120m  WHY+R\033[0m  Reload                      \033[38;5;120mWHY+S\033[0m  Capture visible viewport
\033[38;5;120m  WHY+B\033[0m  Back                        \033[38;5;120mWHY+Z\033[0m  Capture complete page
\033[38;5;120m  WHY+G\033[0m  Forward                     \033[38;5;120mWHY+Q\033[0m  Quit
\033[38;5;120m  WHY+I\033[0m  Page information


\033[38;5;223m  SCREENSHOTS\033[0m

\033[38;5;87m  Press WHY+S to capture the visible 716x716 Mini Browser viewport.\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  Press WHY+Z to capture the complete rendered page.\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  Screenshots are transmitted over USB serial with CRC/FEC protection.\033[0m

