\033[38;5;223m  ABOUT MINI BROWSER\033[0m

\033[38;5;87m  Mini Browser intentionally has no JavaScript engine, CSS layout engine\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  or full HTML DOM. It focuses on ordinary server-rendered HTML, text,\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  links, images and simple GET and POST forms.\033[0m


